ana.py:325:        assert Color.BLACK in pool.last_payment_colors\n--\nengine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:15:| `test_mana.py` | ManaPool — add, pay, can_pay, auto-pay generic, last_payment_colors (Converge). |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-16-| `test_hybrid_mana.py` | Hybrid mana symbol parsing (`{W/U}`, `{R/G}`, etc.), `can_pay()`/`pay()` with backtracking hybrid resolution. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-17-| `test_card.py` | GameObject IDs, CardImpl hook methods, Creature/Instant/Sorcery/Enchantment/Artifact/Planeswalker subclasses, Mode, ActivatedAbility, LoyaltyAbility, cost_reduction hook. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-18-| `test_game_state.py` | GameState construction, phase/step tracking, advance_phase. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-19-| `test_extra_turns.py` | Extra turns FIFO queue, granting, ordering, normal turn order resumption. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-20-| `test_stack.py` | StackObject, Stack LIFO, priority_loop, SBA checking. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-21-| `test_casting.py` | cast_spell, play_land, mana payment, target selection, auto-registration, cost reduction integration, filter_fn validation at cast time. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-22-| `test_cost_reduction.py` | Cost reduction clamping, application, cast_spell integration. |\n/workspace/engine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-23-| `test_combat.py` | Declare attackers/blockers, combat damage, first strike, double strike, trample, lifelink, deathtouch, flying/reach, menace, vigilance, protection blocking/damage checks. |\n--\ncards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py:39:    payer's ``mana_pool.last_payment_colors``; the card reads it on\n/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py-40-    resolution. These tests bypass the cast pipeline and set\n/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py-41-    ``colors_spent`` directly so the converge logic can be exercised\n/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py-