{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tpo6BMckrKePZ3skbtGv7P","type":"tool_result","content":"185\t### SOS 245 — Witherbloom, the Balancer  ({6}{B}{G} Elder Dragon 5/5)\n186\t- **Clauses**: Affinity for creatures (self: {1} less per creature you control).\n187\t  Flying, deathtouch. Instant/sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures.\n188\t- **Analogue**: self-reduction like the `cost_reduction` contract in\n189\t  `engine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py`.\n190\t- **Seam**: constructor `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.DEATHTOUCH`, 5/5, LEGENDARY,\n191\t  `{\"Dragon\",\"Elder\"}`. `def cost_reduction(self, game): return count of creatures\n192\t  self.controller controls` (self-affinity, existing hook). `def static_cost_reduction(\n193\t  self, game, spell, controller): return (creatures controller controls) if spell is\n194\t  I/S and spell.controller is self.controller and self on battlefield else 0` (grants\n195\t  affinity to your I/S).\n196\t- **New engine**: gap row 4 (extend `get_cost_reduction` to sum battlefield\n197\t  `static_cost_reduction`).\n198\t- **Edge cases**: counting Witherbloom itself toward self-affinity (it's not on the\n199\t  battlefield while being cast → not counted, correct); reduction clamped to generic\n200\t  (existing clamp); an I/S you cast while controlling N creatures costs {N} less but\n201\t  never below colored pips; opponent's I/S unaffected.\n202\t\n203\t### SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} Legendary Creature 7/7, Reach)\n204\t- **Clauses**: costs {1} less per I/S in your graveyard; Reach; \"Whenever ~ attacks,\n205\t  you may cast target I/S from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that\n206\t  spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n207\t- **Analogue**: `fdn_245` (attack trigger), `fdn_48`/`fdn_13` (targeting), self\n208\t  `cost_reduction` contract.\n209\t- **Seam**: `cost_reduction(self, game)` = count I/S in `self.controller` graveyard."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b0c2803-fb7f-4347-8991-d01b6c022fd2","uuid":"dd28c21a-f82c-44aa-94e3-b1f3be95f0a1","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:18:27.468Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### SOS 245 — Witherbloom, the Balancer  ({6}{B}{G} Elder Dragon 5/5)\n- **Clauses**: Affinity for creatures (self: {1} less per creature you control).\n  Flying, deathtouch. Instant/sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures.\n- **Analogue**: self-reduction like the `cost_reduction` contract in\n  `engine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py`.\n- **Seam**: constructor `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.DEATHTOUCH`, 5/5, LEGENDARY,\n  `{\"Dragon\",\"Elder\"}`. `def cost_reduction(self, game): return count of creatures\n  self.controller controls` (self-affinity, existing hook). `def static_cost_reduction(\n  self, game, spell, controller): return (creatures controller controls) if spell is\n  I/S and spell.controller is self.controller and self on battlefield else 0` (grants\n  affinity to your I/S).\n- **New engine**: gap row 4 (extend `get_cost_reduction` to sum battlefield\n  `static_cost_reduction`).\n- **Edge cases**: counting Witherbloom itself toward self-affinity (it's not on the\n  battlefield while being cast → not counted, correct); reduction clamped to generic\n  (existing clamp); an I/S you cast while controlling N creatures costs {N} less but\n  never below colored pips; opponent's I/S unaffected.\n\n### SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} Legendary Creature 7/7, Reach)\n- **Clauses**: costs {1} less per I/S in your graveyard; Reach; \"Whenever ~ attacks,\n  you may cast target I/S from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that\n  spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n- **Analogue**: `fdn_245` (attack trigger), `fdn_48`/`fdn_13` (targeting), self\n  `cost_reduction` contract.\n- **Seam**: `cost_reduction(self, game)` = count I/S in `self.controller` graveyard.","numLines":25,"startLine":185,"totalLines":390}}}
