{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016mcDLxDHP999qFJxP5FEBX","type":"tool_result","content":"240\t### SOS 201 — Lorehold, the Historian  ({3}{R}{W} Elder Dragon 5/5)\n241\t- **Clauses**: Flying, haste. Each I/S in your hand has miracle {2}. At the beginning\n242\t  of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a card.\n243\t- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` (passive trigger), `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` is already fired\n244\t  by `draw_card`.\n245\t- **Seam**: constructor `Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`, 5/5, LEGENDARY. Opponent-upkeep\n246\t  loot: register `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` (already fired) with condition\n247\t  `game.active_player is not self.controller`; effect: `choose_yes_no`; if yes and\n248\t  hand non-empty, `discard` a chosen card then `draw_card`. Miracle: register\n249\t  `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` with condition `event.player is self.controller` AND\n250\t  `event.card` is I/S AND it's the first card drawn this turn\n251\t  (`player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`); effect: optionally `cast` the drawn card for an\n252\t  alternative {2} cost — simplest model: temporarily treat its cost as `{2}` and call\n253\t  `cast_spell` (or `cast_spell_free` after manually charging {2} from the pool).\n254\t- **New engine**: none (both events already fired). Miracle is a card-local alternative\n255\t  cost; document the simplification (`# ENGINE LIMITATION: miracle modeled as may-cast\n256\t  for {2} on first draw`).\n257\t- **Edge cases**: only the FIRST card drawn each turn is eligible (use\n258\t  `cards_drawn_this_turn`); only I/S; Lorehold's own upkeep does NOT trigger the loot\n259\t  (only opponents'); declining the discard draws nothing; granting miracle only while\n260\t  Lorehold is on the battlefield.\n261\t\n262\t### SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} Creature 3/3, Prepared)\n263\t- **Clauses**: ETB — target player creates a 1/1 W/B Inkling with flying. Then if an\n264\t  opponent controls more creatures than you, this becomes \"prepared\". While prepared,\n265\t  you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords: exile target creature, its controller gains\n266\t  life = its power); doing so unprepares it.\n267\t- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` token creation + targeting; ETB via `register_triggers` on\n268\t  `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` (condition `event.permanent is self`).\n269\t- **Seam**: constructor `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (front face), 3/3,\n270\t  LEGENDARY? (spec has no Legendary supertype — it's not legendary; subtypes\n271\t  `{\"Cat\",\"Cleric\"}`), keep a `self._prepared=False` flag. ETB effect: create Inkling\n272\t  token (`create_token(game, target_player, Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1,\n273\t  base_toughness=1, subtypes={\"Inkling\"}, keywords=Keyword.FLYING))`), then count\n274\t  creatures: if any opponent controls more creatures than controller → `self._prepared=True`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b0c2803-fb7f-4347-8991-d01b6c022fd2","uuid":"fa6d2b61-7dbb-438c-b650-a3488e24e3cd","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:24:33.304Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### SOS 201 — Lorehold, the Historian  ({3}{R}{W} Elder Dragon 5/5)\n- **Clauses**: Flying, haste. Each I/S in your hand has miracle {2}. At the beginning\n  of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a card.\n- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` (passive trigger), `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` is already fired\n  by `draw_card`.\n- **Seam**: constructor `Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`, 5/5, LEGENDARY. Opponent-upkeep\n  loot: register `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` (already fired) with condition\n  `game.active_player is not self.controller`; effect: `choose_yes_no`; if yes and\n  hand non-empty, `discard` a chosen card then `draw_card`. Miracle: register\n  `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` with condition `event.player is self.controller` AND\n  `event.card` is I/S AND it's the first card drawn this turn\n  (`player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`); effect: optionally `cast` the drawn card for an\n  alternative {2} cost — simplest model: temporarily treat its cost as `{2}` and call\n  `cast_spell` (or `cast_spell_free` after manually charging {2} from the pool).\n- **New engine**: none (both events already fired). Miracle is a card-local alternative\n  cost; document the simplification (`# ENGINE LIMITATION: miracle modeled as may-cast\n  for {2} on first draw`).\n- **Edge cases**: only the FIRST card drawn each turn is eligible (use\n  `cards_drawn_this_turn`); only I/S; Lorehold's own upkeep does NOT trigger the loot\n  (only opponents'); declining the discard draws nothing; granting miracle only while\n  Lorehold is on the battlefield.\n\n### SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} Creature 3/3, Prepared)\n- **Clauses**: ETB — target player creates a 1/1 W/B Inkling with flying. Then if an\n  opponent controls more creatures than you, this becomes \"prepared\". While prepared,\n  you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords: exile target creature, its controller gains\n  life = its power); doing so unprepares it.\n- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` token creation + targeting; ETB via `register_triggers` on\n  `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` (condition `event.permanent is self`).\n- **Seam**: constructor `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (front face), 3/3,\n  LEGENDARY? (spec has no Legendary supertype — it's not legendary; subtypes\n  `{\"Cat\",\"Cleric\"}`), keep a `self._prepared=False` flag. ETB effect: create Inkling\n  token (`create_token(game, target_player, Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1,\n  base_toughness=1, subtypes={\"Inkling\"}, keywords=Keyword.FLYING))`), then count\n  creatures: if any opponent controls more creatures than controller → `self._prepared=True`.","numLines":35,"startLine":240,"totalLines":390}}}
