{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014oUMKWU4nm3ZJs8y7Wvgct","type":"tool_result","content":"262\t### SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} Creature 3/3, Prepared)\n263\t- **Clauses**: ETB — target player creates a 1/1 W/B Inkling with flying. Then if an\n264\t  opponent controls more creatures than you, this becomes \"prepared\". While prepared,\n265\t  you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords: exile target creature, its controller gains\n266\t  life = its power); doing so unprepares it.\n267\t- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` token creation + targeting; ETB via `register_triggers` on\n268\t  `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` (condition `event.permanent is self`).\n269\t- **Seam**: constructor `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (front face), 3/3,\n270\t  LEGENDARY? (spec has no Legendary supertype — it's not legendary; subtypes\n271\t  `{\"Cat\",\"Cleric\"}`), keep a `self._prepared=False` flag. ETB effect: create Inkling\n272\t  token (`create_token(game, target_player, Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1,\n273\t  base_toughness=1, subtypes={\"Inkling\"}, keywords=Keyword.FLYING))`), then count\n274\t  creatures: if any opponent controls more creatures than controller → `self._prepared=True`.\n275\t  Expose Swords as `get_activated_abilities` returning the prepared ability **only when\n276\t  `self._prepared`** (cost = no-mana / its `{W}` per the back face; pick one and\n277\t  document): effect = exile target creature and `target.controller.life += target.power`,\n278\t  then `self._prepared=False`.\n279\t- **New engine**: none (token + exile + life already exist). \"Cast a copy\" modeled as\n280\t  the inline activated ability (see copy note).\n281\t- **Edge cases**: ETB target player could be the controller or opponent; the \"more\n282\t  creatures\" check counts the just-made Inkling; prepared ability disappears after one\n283\t  use; exiling a creature with 0 power gains 0 life; no creatures to target while\n284\t  prepared.\n285\t\n286\t### SOS 97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer  ({1}{B}{B} Planeswalker, loyalty 3)\n287\t- **Clauses**: +1 Surveil 2. −1 any number of target players each discard a card. −2\n288\t  return target creature MV ≤3 from your graveyard to battlefield. −7 flip 5 coins;\n289\t  target opponent skips their next X turns (X = heads).\n290\t- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` (`Planeswalker`, `get_loyalty_abilities`, `_resolve_target`,\n291\t  `draw_card`/`discard`/`create_token`).\n292\t- **Seam**: subclass `Planeswalker(starting_loyalty=3)`, LEGENDARY, subtypes `{\"Ral\"}`.\n293\t  `get_loyalty_abilities` → four `LoyaltyAbility`:\n294\t  - `+1`: `surveil(game, self.controller, 2)`.\n295\t  - `−1`: each target player `discard` a chosen card (2-player: opponent and/or self).\n296\t  - `−2`: choose target creature card in `self.controller` graveyard with\n297\t    `mana_cost.cmc <= 3`; `move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)`.\n298\t  - `−7`: `heads = sum(flip_coin(game, self.controller) for _ in range(5))`; choose a\n299\t    target opponent seat `i`; `game.skipped_turns[i] = game.skipped_turns.get(i,0) + heads`.\n300\t- **New engine**: gap row 6 (`flip_coin`), row 7 (skip-turns in `advance_phase`), row 8\n301\t  (`surveil`). −1/−2 reuse existing helpers."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b0c2803-fb7f-4347-8991-d01b6c022fd2","uuid":"547b46e8-d3ef-4bbd-95cf-6e9be6fc4c39","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:27:17.389Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} Creature 3/3, Prepared)\n- **Clauses**: ETB — target player creates a 1/1 W/B Inkling with flying. Then if an\n  opponent controls more creatures than you, this becomes \"prepared\". While prepared,\n  you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords: exile target creature, its controller gains\n  life = its power); doing so unprepares it.\n- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` token creation + targeting; ETB via `register_triggers` on\n  `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` (condition `event.permanent is self`).\n- **Seam**: constructor `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (front face), 3/3,\n  LEGENDARY? (spec has no Legendary supertype — it's not legendary; subtypes\n  `{\"Cat\",\"Cleric\"}`), keep a `self._prepared=False` flag. ETB effect: create Inkling\n  token (`create_token(game, target_player, Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1,\n  base_toughness=1, subtypes={\"Inkling\"}, keywords=Keyword.FLYING))`), then count\n  creatures: if any opponent controls more creatures than controller → `self._prepared=True`.\n  Expose Swords as `get_activated_abilities` returning the prepared ability **only when\n  `self._prepared`** (cost = no-mana / its `{W}` per the back face; pick one and\n  document): effect = exile target creature and `target.controller.life += target.power`,\n  then `self._prepared=False`.\n- **New engine**: none (token + exile + life already exist). \"Cast a copy\" modeled as\n  the inline activated ability (see copy note).\n- **Edge cases**: ETB target player could be the controller or opponent; the \"more\n  creatures\" check counts the just-made Inkling; prepared ability disappears after one\n  use; exiling a creature with 0 power gains 0 life; no creatures to target while\n  prepared.\n\n### SOS 97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer  ({1}{B}{B} Planeswalker, loyalty 3)\n- **Clauses**: +1 Surveil 2. −1 any number of target players each discard a card. −2\n  return target creature MV ≤3 from your graveyard to battlefield. −7 flip 5 coins;\n  target opponent skips their next X turns (X = heads).\n- **Analogue**: `fdn_44` (`Planeswalker`, `get_loyalty_abilities`, `_resolve_target`,\n  `draw_card`/`discard`/`create_token`).\n- **Seam**: subclass `Planeswalker(starting_loyalty=3)`, LEGENDARY, subtypes `{\"Ral\"}`.\n  `get_loyalty_abilities` → four `LoyaltyAbility`:\n  - `+1`: `surveil(game, self.controller, 2)`.\n  - `−1`: each target player `discard` a chosen card (2-player: opponent and/or self).\n  - `−2`: choose target creature card in `self.controller` graveyard with\n    `mana_cost.cmc <= 3`; `move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)`.\n  - `−7`: `heads = sum(flip_coin(game, self.controller) for _ in range(5))`; choose a\n    target opponent seat `i`; `game.skipped_turns[i] = game.skipped_turns.get(i,0) + heads`.\n- **New engine**: gap row 6 (`flip_coin`), row 7 (skip-turns in `advance_phase`), row 8\n  (`surveil`). −1/−2 reuse existing helpers.","numLines":40,"startLine":262,"totalLines":390}}}
