{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01EPHsGYswSGzvTFW6qUw7b6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 SOS cards are implemented and the full test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nCompleted the final four cards this session (SOS 13, 1, 97, 120), finishing all 10. Full suite: **1283 passed** (1145 engine regression + 99 SOS + 39 FDN reference), zero regressions.\n\nThe four cards completed now:\n\n- **SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares** (`Creature`): self-ETB trigger creates a 1/1 flying Inkling for a target player, then sets `_prepared` if an opponent controls more creatures; the prepared \"Swords\" half is exposed as an activated ability (only while prepared) that exiles a creature, gives its controller life equal to its power, and unprepares. 14 tests.\n- **SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic** (`Creature`): `cost_reduction` = count of instants/sorceries in your graveyard (Seam 4); attack trigger (Seam 2) free-casts a target I/S from the graveyard and registers a `SpellResolvesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (Seam 5) redirecting it to exile. 11 tests.\n- **SOS 97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer** (`Planeswalker`): four loyalty abilities — +1 surveil 2, −1 any-number-of-targets discard, −2 reanimate a ≤3-MV creature from graveyard, −7 flip 5 coins and add heads to the opponent's seat in `game.skipped_turns` (Seams 6/7/8). 12 tests.\n- **SOS 120 — Improvisation Capstone** (`Sorcery`): impulse-exiles from library until total MV ≥ 4 and may free-cast them; Paradigm self-exiles via replacement and registers a once-per-controller `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` emblem (Seam 3) that recasts a fresh free copy each precombat main. 9 tests.\n\nAll engine changes stayed additive; `test_extra_turns` and `test_cost_reduction` remained green throughout."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_read_input_tokens":156113